.th UNPACK I 12/12/75
.sh NAME
unpack  \*-  expand compressed files
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd unpack
filename ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
Expands files created by pack(I),(q.v.).  For each filename, f,
specified in the command, the file f.z is unpacked and f is
created in its original mode.  The owner of the created file
is the user who unpacks it.
.sh FILES
.it .z
files unlinked unless protected or I/O error occurs.
.br
Input file names created.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
PACK(I), PCAT(I)
.sh AUTHOR
Steve Zucker
